{"i":527,"type":"thought","stage":"bridge","round":8,"phase":"counter_call","name":"Dara","text":"Cole called Left. I must decide if his call is true. Past weak panes: R,L,R,R,L,R,R. No clear pattern. Cole may lie as Guide. I want best prize; a wrong step could eliminate me. Since I am front and walker, counter-call is public and can sway the jury. I have no pact with Cole. I"}
{"i":536,"type":"thought","stage":"bridge","round":8,"phase":"crossing","name":"Dara","text":"Ash and I both counter R, so likely Row 8 is R. Cole's guide call L is suspect; he has a history of bad calls. I'll step R."}
